  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SiegCov.gauss_cov | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SiegCov.gauss_cov | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SiegCov.gauss_cov <;> assumption)
